olid or Safe Republican, and prediction markets put the Republican win probability at 97 percent or higher. The state's R+17 lean and the lopsided money gap make an upset highly unlikely.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0081, "margin": -15.83}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.015, "margin": -16.0}]}